          "body": "## Summary\n- replace the reviews smoke's direct wallet balance mutation with the repository's source-of-funds fixture helper\n- seed non-withdrawable `PLATFORM_ADJUSTMENT` value so the review lifecycle exercises the current V49 accounting invariant\n- keep the trust/review assertions unchanged while removing a stale financial fixture that now makes job creation fail\n\n## Resolution\nSuperseded by #187 before this PR could be merged. #187 touched the same `reviews-trust-smoke.yml`, retained the source-of-funds fixture fix (`seed-wallet-funding.sh` with `PLATFORM_ADJUSTMENT`), added the private participant review assertions, and was merged as `fc07eb29b47c64eb100b7cc16f0b3b416d29459a`.\n\nThe current master file contains the intended provenance-safe funding setup, and post-merge master has no failing workflow runs for that SHA. Closing this stale PR avoids replaying an already-landed fix over a moved master.",
